{{Clear}}

==Lap Time==

It takes between 35 to 40 seconds to reach the sq'irk tree, yielding 103 [[spring sq'irk]]s or 25 [[spring sq'irkjuice]] per hour. This assumes near perfect laps and constant running. Players can expect around 21 [[spring sq'irkjuice]] per hour equalling about 28,350 xp/h

